#: utilities.php:2280
msgid "The Kadupul Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Kadupul Log 根据系统设置存储统计信息,错误信息和其他信息.这些信息可以用来识别poller 和应用程序的问题."

#: utilities.php:2284
